@page "/"

<PageTitle>QuickGrid URL state in .NET 11</PageTitle>

<h1>QuickGrid URL state in .NET 11</h1>

<p>
    A static-SSR-only Blazor app (no interactivity mode configured for the pages below, except where
    noted). Sorting and paging work through plain links and query string parameters.
</p>

<ul>
    <li><a href="/people">/people</a> — single grid, sortable columns, paginator, plus an app-owned <code>?country=</code> filter</li>
    <li><a href="/provider">/provider</a> — the same grid driven by <code>GridItemsProvider</code> (server-side paging)</li>
    <li><a href="/multi">/multi</a> — two grids on one page, second grid using a <code>c_</code> parameter prefix</li>
    <li><a href="/people-interactive">/people-interactive</a> — the same grid on an interactive-server page</li>
</ul>
